Package: MultiNorm
Type: Package
Title: Spatially Aware Normalisation for Multi-Slice Spatial Transcriptomics Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        given = "Lahiru",
        family = "Boyagoda",
        email = "wboyagoda@student.unimelb.edu.au",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-1367-2279")
    )  )
Description: Provides a spatially aware normalisation method for multi-slice
    spatial transcriptomics data. The method decomposes gene expression
    variation into unwanted technical variation and biologically
    variation, aiming to remove technical effects while preserving biological
    signals. It further incorporates constraints to preserve the similarity
    of average biological signals within pre-identified regions (niches)
    across tissue slices.
